        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 기계설계 · 평기어의 축간 거리와 회전속도
정답은 ③이다. 축간 거리 C = m(Z1 + Z2)/2 = 2 × 90/2 = 90 mm이다. 기어의 회전속도는 600 × 30/60 = 300 rpm이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>45 300</choice_text>
          <commentary>축간 거리 45 mm는 모듈을 빠뜨린 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>45 600</choice_text>
          <commentary>축간 거리와 회전속도가 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>90 300</choice_text>
          <commentary>90 mm, 300 rpm이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>90 600</choice_text>
          <commentary>기어의 회전속도는 감속되어 300 rpm이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="15" id="PRB-B9A2CDF0D939C3EF-Q15">
      <question_stem>치직각 모듈이 4 mm, 비틀림각(나선각)이 30 °, 잇수가 90개인 헬리컬 기어의 피치원 지름[mm]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>치직각</keyword>
        <keyword>모듈</keyword>
        <keyword>비틀림각</keyword>
        <keyword>나선각</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$240 \sqrt{3}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 기계설계 · 헬리컬 기어의 피치원 지름
정답은 ④이다. 피치원 지름 D = mnZ/cosβ = 4 × 90 ÷ cos30° = 360 ÷ (√3/2) = 720/√3 = 240√3 mm이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$720$</choice_text>
          <commentary>720 mm는 cos30°로 나누지 않고 2배한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$360 \sqrt{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>360√3 mm는 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$360 \sqrt{2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>360√2 mm는 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$240 \sqrt{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>D = 240√3 mm이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
